@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071/api
@managerToken = REPLACE_WITH_MANAGER_TOKEN
@assignedOutletId = REPLACE_WITH_ASSIGNED_OUTLET_ID
@unassignedOutletId = REPLACE_WITH_UNASSIGNED_OUTLET_ID

### Assigned active outlets only
GET {{baseUrl}}/manage/dashboard/outlets
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### Read-only dashboard for an assigned outlet
GET {{baseUrl}}/manage/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
X-Outlet-Id: {{assignedOutletId}}

### Dashboard finance and current operational data, including comparison dates
GET {{baseUrl}}/manage/dashboard/range?from=2026-10-25&to=2026-11-14
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
X-Outlet-Id: {{assignedOutletId}}

### Selected-period orders and older active operational orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/manage/dashboard/orders?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-14&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
X-Outlet-Id: {{assignedOutletId}}

### Range reads must reject unassigned outlets
GET {{baseUrl}}/manage/dashboard/range?from=2026-10-25&to=2026-11-14
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
X-Outlet-Id: {{unassignedOutletId}}

### Invalid order page must return 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/manage/dashboard/orders?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-14&page=0
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
X-Outlet-Id: {{assignedOutletId}}

### Unassigned outlet must return 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/manage/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
X-Outlet-Id: {{unassignedOutletId}}

### No authentication must return 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/manage/dashboard/outlets

### Current recorded collections by IST order date (same totals as Web Sales)
GET {{baseUrl}}/manage/reports/order-period-collection?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-14
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
X-Outlet-Id: {{assignedOutletId}}

### Unassigned collection outlet must return 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/manage/reports/order-period-collection?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-14
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
X-Outlet-Id: {{unassignedOutletId}}
